# vehje-check. backlog

Designed but deferred. Names stay unbackticked until they ship.

## The full reachability qualifier lattice

The shipping lease is the immutable strictly-nested depth-lease floor. The full
reachability qualifier lattice (mutable, aliased, and escaping cases) grows the
reach-mask inference additively, unlocking the mutable-consumer story, gated on
the avoidance-rate experiment (measure the inference failure rate on real
Lua-shaped census code: a low rate is the type-system strength realised, a high
rate is a mostly-dynamic mutable lease learned early). The floor's metatheorem is
the proven valve.

## The avoidance-boundary generational residual

Where avoidance fails and a value escapes past what the reach-mask can express,
the per-reference generational-reference check is the dynamic residual. Its
inference (detecting the un-placeable reference) and its wire-format flag land
with the mutable-consumer extension; the flag slot in the wire format is
schema-now.

## The assurance-indexed logical relation

The full metatheory beyond the shippable grade enums (the assurance-indexed
gradual logical relation, the lambda_veh theorems) is a proof-document artifact
drafted in parallel with the experiments, not code in this crate. Its grade-0
operational shadow is the runtime-generation differential harness.

## The concrete family-check registration surface

The family-extension hook surface (how a consumer registers its own graded
checks) lands with the first consumer family.

## The dir rename

The crate directory renames from vehje-typecheck to vehje-check in the source
phase of this round.
